WEBVTT

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.310
Good morning!

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.940
Good morning-pri!
Good morning!

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:08.040
Hm? Where's Mr. Kuma?

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.220
Out shopping-pri.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.250
Pardon me.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:16.240
Mireille, congratulations on your one year PriPara anniversary!

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.640
Pri!

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.950
That said, we offer no particular reward for the milestone.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:20.950
Nothing-pri?

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:25.540
Nevertheless, I'm here on behalf of PriPara's management to congratulate you.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.880
And with the sentiment passed along, I will be leaving.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.380
It really was just sentiment-pri...

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.940
So it's been a whole year for you!

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.480
Congratulations.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.520
Th-Thank you.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.310
Hm? But wait...

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.890
You're in seventh grade now, right?

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:48.360
So when you debuted a year ago you were still in elementary school, right?

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:51.170
Of... Of course not!

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.990
But according to your precious calculations...

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:58.510
I'll help out!

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:00.120
Y-You don't have to!

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:05.370
What? What do you have to hide! I'll help out!

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.380
An elementary uniform like mine!

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:14.340
Doesn't that mean you've been coming to PriPara since you were in elementary school?

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:17.400
Puh... ri?

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:57.110
Okay, fine-pri. You're right-pri.

00:02:57.590 --> 00:02:59.730
I knew it!

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:02.190
Why didn't you tell me?

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:05.210
I bet you could have taught me a bunch of tricks!

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:06.230
Well...

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:11.420
I've been coming here since I was in elementary school too.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:12.540
Well, you were...

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:16.780
...in a different school back then.

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:24.010
Yeah. And I constantly have to feel like Ookanda is watching my every move.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.680
I'm amazed you managed to keep it a secret.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:30.780
It was no problem with my precise calculations in place.

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:32.770
Really? Tell me, tell me!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.440
To eliminate every trace of the scent of PriTickets...

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:40.600
You put them in three layers of plastic bags inside a metal tin,

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:44.350
and shut out the scent with bits of charcoal and some spray.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:48.370
I spared no expense in PriTicket handling at home.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:54.380
And since I was the student council president,
I knew the days we'd have inspections beforehand.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.710
Plus, nobody would suspect the president.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.910
No way can I keep up...

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:02.010
Right? So I figured I didn't need to bring it up.

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:04.430
I've done it now-kuma!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:10.140
Recharge... I was supposed to go recharge Mireille's PriPass...

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.480
PriPass?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.830
B-Because I had all this other stuff...

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.940
Spit it out-pri!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:19.150
I dropped it somewhere-kuma!

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.770
Whaaaat?! Come on!

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:24.980
How could you lose someone's PriPass? Unbelievable-pri!

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:28.700
I-It's your fault for dumping all the shopping on me-kuma!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.080
That's unrelated-pri!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:31.890
Pri-kuma?

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:33.920
Don't play dumb-pri!

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:35.630
We gotta hurry up and find it!

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.910
Without your PriPass...

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.270
When we do the Cyalume Change, Mireille...

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:43.450
...won't be able to do it!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:47.510
Everyone but me getting to glow is no good-pri!

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:51.300
Kuma! If you can't find it, you're fired!

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:54.270
Whaaat?! You can't do that-kuma!

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.940
And after making me do your chores, too...

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:00.930
After I've been the very image of a model manager...

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:01.480
Come on!

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:04.950
Shut up-pri! Losing the glowiness of your idol like that,

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:08.230
you're the image of a useless no-good manager!

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:10.410
Shock!

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.370
You're terrible-kuma! No-good-kuma!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.640
Mr. Kuma! I'll go look for him.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:24.310
I'll help you find your PriPass!

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:25.760
Uh, okay.

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:28.720
Mr. Kuma!

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.860
Mr. Kuma!

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:39.060
Mr. Kuma, don't  do something you'll regret!

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:46.480
What was that for-kuma?

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:50.280
I was just checking to if the PriPass had fallen into the fountain-kuma!

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.210
Uh, well...

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:56.250
You just looked so brooding and I... Sorry.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:06:00.190
I see-kuma. But don't worry-kuma.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:02.300
I know how it looks, but we're actually...

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:06.200
There we go... Friends forged in fire.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:08.470
I know her quirks-kuma.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:14.430
I see! Have you known her since she was my age?

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:18.860
So she finally told you-kuma.

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:21.150
Oh, I know all about that.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:25.690
It's really been a whole year, huh?

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:30.160
I was still getting my start as a novice manager and was unranked.

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:34.310
Oh? Managers have a ranking system too?

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:42.740
You see, new, unproven managers have a two year period to succeed in scouting an idol

00:06:42.740 --> 00:06:44.540
or face dire consequences.

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.270
L-Like what?

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:52.350
There is a place far below PriPara,
known as the Graveyard of Mascots...

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:56.490
You'll be taken down there.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:02.630
But, when I had only a month to go before I was to be condemned to the graveyard,

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:06.050
while wandering in the depths of despair...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.700
a sudden encounter changed my destiny!

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.620
Y-You!

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:22.960
First time in PriPara-kuma?

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:25.340
Wh-What's your name-kuma?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:29.510
You should introduce yourself before asking anyone else to.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:31.550
Pri!

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.680
Puh... Pri?

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:37.210
Oh, no, that's just quite a unique thing to say-kuma!

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:38.520
I quite like it-kuma.

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:42.480
I have my idol personality for maximizing popularity all figured out!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.440
Ohh...

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.900
Oh, I forgot to introduce myself.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:49.630
I'm a scout and manager both,

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:54.370
Klaus Henrik Poncetta von Bogel Strobel Cash de la Manecca the Third-kuma.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:57.290
Too long. Just Kuma will do.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:01.080
I'm Minami Mireille, sixth grader. Pri!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.990
Mireille-kuma, is it?

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:07.290
So, without further ado, why don't you make me your manager?

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.390
I will certainly make you,

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:13.460
Lady Mireille, into a Divine Idol-kuma!

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:19.860
Sorry, but I've already decided my manager should be someone more charismatic, with clear initiative.

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:23.140
G-Give me a chance here-kuma!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:25.270
What have my little ears just heard-usa?

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:31.480
A charismatic talent scout, a manager of considerable skill. <i>I</i> am the one you're looking for-usa!

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:36.660
I wouldn't mind escorting you through your life in PriPara.

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:38.780
I won't team up with you-pri.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:39.630
What?

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:45.490
Taking up the offer of a buffoon who hands their business cards one-handed is obviously a bad move-pri.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.540
How cool-kuma!

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:51.980
<i>What a quick thinker she is-kuma!</i>

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:56.890
<i>And that "pri" thing is pretty good-kuma! Pretty good!</i>

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:06.070
So after that I just <i>had</i> to keep my eye on her.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.070
Stop!

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:13.780
Your timing on the arm raising is 0.48 seconds off-pri!

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.330
You're too nitpicky, Mireille!

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:20.870
If you're aiming for perfection, even a fraction of a second missed is too much.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:28.490
Rika, you're spending 1.82% more time than me in the center-pri!

00:09:28.490 --> 00:09:30.540
Eh? Aren't you just imagining that?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.680
No! The numbers don't lie-pri.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.010
I can't team up with a spotlight hog-pri.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.970
Wh-What?

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.390
No-pri! Your pitch is all wrong-pri!

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:47.680
The proper frequency for a "la" should be 440 hertz-pri!

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:53.320
What's this about hertz? That complicated stuff is beyond me.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.740
It's not complicated-pri!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:58.090
Your smile is too stiff-pri!

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.950
Keep your back straight-pri!

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:02.910
You have to start eating taiyaki from the tail-pri!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.270
She was so intent on making everything perfect.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:13.330
She scared everyone off, and wound up without any teammates-kuma.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:31.760
I didn't think starting a team would be so hard-pri.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:34.980
And my catchphrase isn't really coming along either...

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:36.940
PriPara is pretty tough-pri.

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:38.900
You there, lost in thought.

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:40.280
Pri?

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.400
Ah, the bear from back then?

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.620
Why are you so beat up-pri?

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:49.930
I've basically got one foot in the Mascot Graveyard-kuma.

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:54.090
But if you ask me, you're the one that looks beat up-kuma.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:57.290
Me? Beat up?

00:10:57.290 --> 00:11:00.370
Your heart is-kuma.

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:03.920
But worry not-kuma. I will become your manager,

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:05.930
and give you just the advice you need-kuma!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.890
The only thing I trust is my own mind.

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.520
I don't need anyone's advice-pri!

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:17.480
Truth is, I've been observing you-kuma.

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:18.650
Pri?

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:23.310
And I agree that perfecting your dancing and singing is important-kuma.

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:26.060
But that's not all there is-kuma.

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:28.620
What the people truly want...

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:32.420
Is a gentle, heartfelt performance-kuma.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:41.140
It would be no exaggeration to say the sage advice I gave then changed her life-kuma.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.340
Wow!

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.780
I'm afraid nobody's brought in any lost PriPasses.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.380
I see... Thank you-pri.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.770
Can't find the PriPass...

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:58.000
What if we don't find it-pri?

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.740
So soft...

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:21.670
Feels good, right?

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:29.280
These mushy plushies have been more popular than the old ones that are packed full of stuffing lately.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.060
Feels soothing, right?

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:35.720
I see... Being too stiff is no good for plushes either.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:39.900
I think I get what Kuma was getting at.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:41.900
I'll take this!

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:48.370
I think I was too hard on Kuma.

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:54.550
So did she manage to pull that gentle, heartfelt performance off?

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:55.910
Of course-kuma!

00:12:55.910 --> 00:13:01.050
And that was the first time she won an event-kuma!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:05.000
Thanks for coming, everyone!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.480
I love you all!

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:09.800
Here goes! On your mark,

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:11.470
Pop, Step, Gotcha!

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:15.140
What?! That was super cute!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.940
Mireille! Good job-kuma!

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.120
Kuma!

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:24.030
<i>You're doing good-kuma.</i>

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.330
Forgive me-kuma!

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:37.930
You've failed to scout even a single idol during your two-year evaluation period.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.650
You didn't become a manager.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:43.010
As such, you are deemed dysfunctional.

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:46.460
As of today, you are officially confined to the Mascot Graveyard.

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:50.720
No! Anything but the Mascot Graveyard-kuma!

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:52.670
Wait!

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:59.560
Where are you taking my manager-pri?

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.020
M-Mireille!

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:06.490
And that's how it went.

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:08.570
Mireille!

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.530
You've got your soft spots.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:15.900
Well, it would have been tough to handle all my scheduling alone.

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:18.120
I just didn't have any other options than Kuma-pri.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.500
There you go again!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:24.000
I'm the one who made you as big as you are-kuma!

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.630
Show some gratitude-kuma!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.750
Right back at you-pri!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:28.550
No, you-kuma!

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:30.060
Stuff the kuma-kuma-pri!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.530
Stuff the pri-pri-kuma!

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:37.970
Say what you will, you do actually make a good team even with all the arguing.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:42.270
So, what about the show?

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:46.190
Just 5 minutes to go!

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:48.290
I guess there's on other way...

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:50.660
Mireille, you have to go on without your Cyalume Coord-kuma!

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.680
No way-pri!

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:54.770
Do we retire then?

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:57.500
That's even worse-pri!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.620
Excuse me!

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:03.040
Here are the flowers you ordered.

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:07.350
Eh? I ordered them to out backstage area-kuma.

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:12.090
I brought them there, but with no one there...

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:15.180
Also, you forgot something.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.390
The PriPass!

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:19.230
I left it at the flower shop-kuma!

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:20.770
Thank you-kuma!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.520
I'm so glad it was found-kuma!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.860
Oh, a card?

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:29.780
It says: "Mireille, congratulations on the one-year anniversary!"

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:36.990
I was supposed to hand these over backstage just before the show-kuma...

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:39.040
I guess that didn't go as planned-kuma.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.990
Mr. Kuma sure is nice.

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:46.660
There's still time-pri! Let's hurry up-pri!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.420
Yeah!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.060
You really are a no-good manager.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:01.020
What are you doing, making an idol cry before a show-pri?

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:05.200
This one's for you-pri!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.940
No blinking allowed-pri!

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:15.530
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.950
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.890
Coord Change Start!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:29.180
The brand for Mireille's anniversary is her favorite,

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:31.060
Candy Ala Mode!

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:32.630
Froggy Coord!

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:34.300
Pri!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.840
Making Drama Switch On!

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:53.630
Donuts!

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:04.980
Chestnuts!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:05.540
Apples!

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:06.480
Grapes!

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.250
Ripe Autumn Sweets!

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:15.860
All right.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.980
Cyalume Change!

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:27.290
Pri!

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:15.210
We're having a party today-pri!

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:24.310
When you think about it, SoLaMi SMILE would never have existed if you hadn't met Kuma.

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:27.180
Meeting friends is always important.

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:30.390
Got your juice ready, everyone?

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:32.150
Yeah!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:37.110
To SoLaMi SMILE's bright future! Cheers-kuma!

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:38.650
Cheers!

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.070
Pri!

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:46.840
So this is where Manaka Lala lives?

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.710
This parfait is great.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:56.300
This is absolutely divine! I could eat this all day!

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:01.780
Having strategy meetings here seems like a great idea to me,

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:05.780
especially since we can also keep an eye on the enemy as we do.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.310
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:11.760
PriPara...

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:23.550
Why are we hiding?

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:27.080
Ookanda is in charge of the elementary school.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:30.900
I just don't want any hassle.

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:32.410
Scary...

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:35.540
She's a formidable opponent.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:37.480
Welcome.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:41.300
Where is Manaka Lala?

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:43.700
Lala is out right now.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.550
She couldn't be in <i>PriPara</i>, could she?

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:52.520
PriPara? Lala hasn't said anything about that.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:55.730
She could be keeping it a secret.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:21:00.690
Lying to her parents, heading down a dark and slippery path...

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:06.410
Is PriPara really that bad a place?

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.910
Isn't it totally normal for a girl her age to like that kind of stuff?

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:14.370
No! The mere <i>thought</i> of PriPara is a corruptive influence!

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:16.790
Excuse me.

00:23:06.340 --> 00:23:08.650
A new restaurant in the shopping district!

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:10.910
Papa's Pasta could be in trouble!

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:12.330
Tension Max!

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:13.450
Relax.

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:14.660
Delicious okonomiyaki!

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:16.440
Here you go, sir.

00:23:16.440 --> 00:23:18.410
Could this place be...

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:20.170
Yep, where we live!

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:23.290
We won't lose in business either!

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:25.050
If you say so, Dorothy...

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:28.670
Capisce! I mean, we can't lose!

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:31.060
Next time: Pasta vs. Ninjas!

00:23:31.060 --> 00:23:32.420
Why ninjas?
